[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10921.99, "timestamp": "03:02:01", "text": "因为模型很好，所以有很高的期望。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10924.23, "timestamp": "03:02:04", "text": "对，所以我才这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10927.11, "timestamp": "03:02:07", "text": "纪录片马拉松，这样我就可以像你知道的那样，呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10930.309, "timestamp": "03:02:10", "text": "感觉现在的我还没能融入其中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10933.429, "timestamp": "03:02:13", "text": "因为它必须更多，我不得不放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10934.87, "timestamp": "03:02:14", "text": "现在要付出更多努力，一切都要继续下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10936.95, "timestamp": "03:02:16", "text": "一切都必须更加专业。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10939.83, "timestamp": "03:02:19", "text": "然后，人们对质量也有期望。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10941.99, "timestamp": "03:02:21", "text": "以及资产"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10944.15, "timestamp": "03:02:24", "text": "以及所有内容和精简风格"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10947.429, "timestamp": "03:02:27", "text": "一切都必须改变，对吧？所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10950.23, "timestamp": "03:02:30", "text": "那些都有，我当时就想：啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10956.95, "timestamp": "03:02:36", "text": "哦，不。就像你现在必须工作一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10962.469, "timestamp": "03:02:42", "text": "大约增加了160%。简直就像“哦，天哪，不要啊”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10965.429, "timestamp": "03:02:45", "text": "是的。所以我就想，嗯，我会专注于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10968.15, "timestamp": "03:02:48", "text": "目前是模型，但其余资产"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10971.67, "timestamp": "03:02:51", "text": "现在我可以慢慢地拥有它了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10973.99, "timestamp": "03:02:53", "text": "当然，我也有喜欢它的理由。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10977.67, "timestamp": "03:02:57", "text": "呃，选择一些价格合适的资产。"}]